\newlabel{fig:fig5b}{{6}{5}{Computational efficiency (throughput vs.\ arithmetic intensity). GNNs occupy the memory-bound region (low intensity, low throughput); vision models on NPU achieve higher operational intensity}{figure.caption.9}{}}
